Cell["\<\
If we measure qs1,the probability of outcome 2 is an error, and if we measure \
qs2,the probability of outcome 1  is an error, so we can calculate the \
equivalent expression:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99539299578985*^9, 
  3.995393059760887*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7db815e6-cd99-ad48-968a-\
5229533f24f4"],

