Cell["\<\
Each basis is a QuantumBasis built from its vectors, and re-expressing the \
state there is the whole computation.The frame function\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
values on that basis sit on the diagonal, and the frame condition is Tr of \
the re-expressed state\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9954544556933384`*^9, 
  3.995454476889019*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8ea3119b-2ec1-9740-8eeb-\
fad5ebb1ddd8"],

